    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "0EC7250AF8059D1E",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Kieran! The former Champion of the\\nBB League!\\c\\nHe was also part of the expedition to the\\nunderdepths, if I am not mistaken.\\c\\nHe certainly has talent...and strong ties to you.\\nPerhaps we can convince him to move to Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 234,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04b",
      "hash64": "22016DA3718A99B4",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Carmine! She was part of the expedition\\nto the underdepths, wasn’t she?\\c\\nShe has also accompanied Ms. Briar on other\\nextracurricular excursions. Such experience is\\r\\nof great value.\\c\\nAnd she has strong ties to you... We may be able\\nto convince her to move to Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 174,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 280,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04c",
      "hash64": "22016EA3718A9B67",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Crispin! One of the BB League’s Elite\\nFour, if I am not mistaken.\\c\\nWe have no Fire-type users in our Pokémon\\nLeague, so he would certainly be a breath of\\r\\nfresh air.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04d",
      "hash64": "22016BA3718A964E",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Amarys! One of the BB League’s Elite\\nFour, if I am not mistaken.\\c\\nShe is a Steel-type user, correct? I suppose she\\nwould get along well with Poppy.\\c\\nAnd her level-headed and intricate strategies\\ncould shine well in Paldea...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 237,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04e",
      "hash64": "22016CA3718A9801",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Lacey! One of the BB League’s Elite\\nFour, if I am not mistaken.\\c\\nI hear her father is actually a Gym Leader in the\\nUnova region...\\c\\nWe also have a distinct lack of Fairy-type users\\nin our Pokémon League. I would very much like to\\r\\nspeak with her.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 242,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 261,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_sp02_04f",
      "hash64": "220169A3718A92E8",
      "text": "Ah, yes, Drayton! One of the BB League’s Elite\\nFour, if I am not mistaken.\\c\\nI hear his grandfather is a Gym Leader in the\\nUnova region...\\c\\nAnd Drayton was the reigning Champion of the\\nBB League until Kieran dethroned him... A Trainer\\r\\nof uncommon talent indeed.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
