      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "16538C812756EF6C",
      "text": "...Magnificent as always. I see you’ve continued\\nto hone your skills.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "16538D812756F11F",
      "text": "That settles it for me. I no longer have any\\ndoubts about my decision.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "16538E812756F2D2",
      "text": "There is something I very much wish for you\\nto have.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "16538F812756F485",
      "text": "I hope you think carefully about why I chose to\\ngive you those...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_reward_00",
      "hash64": "DA683437F666C9C0",
      "text": "You received the [VAR 0xFF00(0008)]Elite Gloves [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]from Geeta!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "BFEDE2798BED655D",
      "text": "Another wonderful battle. Please, take this—\\njust something for your time.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "BFEDE1798BED63AA",
      "text": "Regarding the gloves I gave you... Take your time\\nto consider, but know that I await your reply.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "054394CA0CE4491F",
      "text": "An unusual slip-up for one of your talent.\\c\\nI do hope you manage to defeat me next time![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "638FCBE20AE3DFC6",
      "text": "A club emulating the organization and activities\\nof a Pokémon League—such an interesting idea.\\c\\nI’ll be sure to discuss with Director Clavell and\\nsee if we can’t begin something similar in Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 198,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "coach_paldea_top_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "638FCCE20AE3E179",
      "text": "I have been to the Zero Lab a few times myself...\\c\\nbut it never occurred to me to insert the Indigo\\nDisk into the panel by the entrance. You certainly\\r\\nare good at thinking outside the box![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
